<title>USA: Freddie Mac to redeem issues.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac to redeem issues.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corp said Thursday that on November 22 it will redeem one debenture issue with $30 million principal and one fixed-rate medium-term note with $27 million principal, as follows.</p>
<p>  Principal  Interest   Maturity     Cusip</p>
<p> $30 million    6.305    7/22/98   3134A0ET5</p>
<p> $27 million    6.22     6/26/98   312902ET2</p>
<p>Freddie Mac said it will redeem the issues in their entirety at a price equal to 100 percent of principal. It will pay principal plus accrued interest to the redemption date to holders of record as of the close of business on November 21.</p>
</text>
